ños juegan fuera."}, "dansk": {"word": "ud", "forms": "", "pron": "ud", "ipa": "/ˈuðˀ/", "ex": "Børnene løber ud i haven.", "ex_es": "Los niños salen corriendo al jardín."}}}, {"es": "probablemente", "img": null, "level": "A1", "pos": "adverb", "l": {"english": {"word": "probably", "forms": "", "pron": "próbebli", "ipa": "/ˈprɒbəbli/", "ex": "It will probably rain tomorrow.", "ex_es": "Probablemente lloverá mañana."}, "français": {"word": "probablement", "forms": "", "pron": "probablemán", "ipa": "/pʁɔbabləmɑ̃/", "ex": "Il va probablement arriver en retard.", "ex_es": "Probablemente llegará tarde."}, "dansk": {"word": "sandsynligvis", "forms": "", "pron": "sansünlivis", "ipa": "/sanˈsyˀnliˌviˀs/", "ex": "Han kommer sandsynligvis lidt for sent.", "ex_es": "Probablemente llegue un poco tarde."}}}, {"es": "rápidamente", "img": null, "level": "A1", "pos": "adverb", "l": {"english": {"word": "quickly", "forms": "more quickly", "pron": "kuíkli", "ipa": "/ˈkwɪkli/", "ex": "Come quickly, the film's starting!", "ex_es": "¡Ven rápido, que empieza la película!"}, "français": {"word": "vite", "forms": "", "pron": "vit", "ipa": "/vit/", "ex": "Viens vite, le bus arrive !", "ex_es": "¡Ven rápido, que llega el autobús!"}, "dansk": {"word": "hurtigt", "forms": "hurtigere, hurtigst", "pron": "húrtit", "ipa": "/ˈhuɐ̯dit/", "ex": "Hun lærte dansk meget hurtigt.", "ex_es": "Ella aprendió danés muy rápidamente."}}}, {"es": "bastante", "img": null, "level": "A1", "pos": "adverb", "l": {"english": {"word": "quite", "forms": "", "pron": "kuáit", "ipa": "/kwaɪt/", "ex": "The film was quite good.", "ex_es": "La película estuvo bastante bien."}, "français": {"word": "assez", "forms": "", "pron": "asé", "ipa": "/ase/", "ex": "Le film était assez intéressant.", "ex_es": "La película era bastante interesante."}, "dansk": {"word": "ret", "forms": "", "pron": "ret", "ipa": "/ˈʁɛd/", "ex": "Filmen var ret god.", "ex_es": "La película estuvo bastante bien."}}}, {"es": "realmente, muy", "img": null, 